Задача 2. Запросы к таблице db
1. Средняя зарплата руководителей:
SELECT AVG(DISTINCT d1.payment) AS avg_boss_salary
FROM db d1
WHERE d1.user_id IN (SELECT DISTINCT boss_id FROM db WHERE boss_id IS NOT NULL);

2. Среднее количество прямых подчинённых у руководителей:
SELECT AVG(subordinate_count) AS avg_subordinates_per_boss
FROM (
  SELECT boss_id, COUNT(*) AS subordinate_count
  FROM db
  WHERE boss_id IS NOT NULL
  GROUP BY boss_id
) subordinates;

3. Сотрудники с зарплатой выше, чем у их руководителей:
SELECT
  e.user_id AS employee_id,
  e.payment AS employee_salary,
  b.user_id AS boss_id,
  b.payment AS boss_salary
FROM db e
JOIN db b ON e.boss_id = b.user_id
WHERE e.payment > b.payment;

